ned measurement records and their date, number weighed, average weight, total weight, weight gain since the prior measurement, and notes when returned.\",\n     \"when\": \"A user opens the lot weight history.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"The Feedlot web app shall display each lot's weight measurement history as a time-ordered list of dated records including average weight, number weighed, total measured weight, weight gain since the prior measurement, and notes when returned.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-19\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-4\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 0.6666666666666666\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A saved feeding or weight record is available for correction and has affected displayed balances or metrics.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-20.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays the returned revised balances and metrics and retains the original record in the record history.\",\n     \"when\": \"The user edits or voids the record and the service returns revised data.\"\n    }\n   ],\n   \"ears\": \"When a user edits or voids a saved feeding or weight record, the Feedlot web app shall display returned revised balances and metrics while retaining the original record in the record history.\",\n   \"id\": \"REQ-20\",\n   \"op\": \"ADDED\",\n   \"sources\": [\n    \"I-3\",\n    \"I-4\",\n    \"I-5\",\n    \"ASM-7\"\n   ],\n   \"stability\": 1\n  },\n  {\n   \"acceptance\": [\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A lot metrics response contains the requested feed-to-gain fields.\",\n     \"id\": \"AC-22.1\",\n     \"level\": \"ui\",\n     \"then\": \"The screen displays each returned metric and the returned feed-cost-per-gain value.\",\n     \"when\": \"A user opens the lot performance view.\"\n    },\n    {\n     \"given\": \"A lot has a receiving date 100 days before the current date, entry average weight of 1,000 pounds, current average weight of 1,200 pounds, 10,000 pounds total feed consumed, and 4